// THE NETWORK COMING BACK IS HEARD, NOT POLLED FOR (owner ruling, 2026-10-27).
// While anything waits on the API (the session's standing network fault, a
// background agent waiting to be resumed, a request that got no answer), the
// shim probes the API on a fixed beat. The daemon owns the one watcher of the
// operating system's network events (a route socket on macOS, rtnetlink on
